&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Commerce is the global leader in licensed sports merchandise, operating a vertically integrated platform that designs, manufactures, and delivers officially licensed apparel, jerseys, headwear, and collectibles for major leagues, teams, and events worldwide. With more than 900 e-commerce sites and a global omnichannel presence across digital, in-venue, and retail, Fanatics Commerce reaches fans in over 180 countries and powers official fan experiences for many of the world&#39;s most iconic sports properties.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Fanatics, we bring our BOLD Leadership Principles to life every day - building championship teams, obsessing over fans, acting with entrepreneurial speed, and delivering with a determined and relentless mindset.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Head of Operations – EU Fulfilment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Commerce is the global leader in licensed sports merchandise, operating a vertically integrated platform that designs, manufactures, and delivers officially licensed apparel, jerseys, headwear, and collectibles for major leagues, teams, and events worldwide. With more than 900 e-commerce sites and a global omnichannel presence across digital, in-venue, and retail, Fanatics Commerce reaches fans in over 180 countries and powers official fan experiences for many of the world&#39;s most iconic sports properties.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Fanatics, we bring our BOLD Leadership Principles to life every day—building championship teams, obsessing over fans, acting with limitless entrepreneurial spirit, and delivering with a determined and relentless mindset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we continue to scale our global platform, the Head of Operations – EU Fulfilment will play a critical role in leading end-to-end customer fulfilment capability across the EU region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ROLE OVERVIEW&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Vice President, Operations and based in France, the Head of Operations – EU Fulfilment is responsible for leading and directing customer fulfilment across the EU region, building capacity and capability through both owned and third-party operations to service all verticals. The role owns the development and execution of operational strategies that improve speed of delivery, reduce cost, and drive down defects across the full supply chain from first to final mile. The Head of Operations – EU Fulfilment delivers business and fan impact through BOLD leadership and execution excellence, leveraging data, automation, and AI-enabled insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HOW WILL YOU DRIVE IMPACT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success is measured by the ability to deliver results through BOLD capabilities and measurable outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with business leaders and stakeholders across the UK and EU, operational leaders spanning supply chain, freight, fulfilment, and final mile, and local technical and functional teams to align operational plans with broader business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen the France-based operational partnership with internal stakeholders across the international Senior Leadership Team, influencing effectively within a regional, matrixed environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and develop high-performing teams with clear ownership across key partners, verticals, and locations, fostering a culture of collaboration, transparency, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate operational excellence standards into 3PL environments, embedding accountability and performance ownership across all third-party operators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fan &amp;amp; Customer Impact&lt;/strong&gt; (Obsessed with Fans)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute strategies to improve customer and partner satisfaction through faster delivery, lower cost, and reduced defect rates across the EU region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive operational plans that support all verticals and locales, ensuring consistent service quality and fulfilment performance for fans across every channel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage vendor performance, contracts, and service delivery to ensure all partners meet or exceed agreed service levels and customer experience standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the selection and onboarding of new providers to support the growth plans of verticals and locales within the EU region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation &amp;amp; Problem Solving&lt;/strong&gt; (Limitless Entrepreneurial Spirit)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate capital expenditure projects into tangible ROI and measurable service benefits, ensuring investment decisions are grounded in data and operational insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement plans to improve speed to delivery while simultaneously reducing cost and defects, identifying synergies across the EU region to optimise performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a change leader and owner, driving continuous improvement across 3PL and internal operations through innovative thinking and structured execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt; (Determined &amp;amp; Relentless Mindset)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the operations forecast and plans end-to-end, ensuring alignment between operational capacity and business demand across all EU verticals and locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimise the speed and cost of service across the region, balancing efficiency with service quality and partner commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive operational synergies across the EU region, identifying and realising efficiencies that benefit customers, partners, and the broader Fanatics Commerce business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; DIGITAL CAPABILITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building a future-ready organization. This role is expected to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply AI and technology to improve efficiency, quality, and outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data and digital tools to inform decisions and enhance performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate curiosity and adaptability in adopting new technologies and ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a culture of innovation and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CAPABILITIES &amp;amp; EXPERIENCE YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of operational leadership experience within complex, multi-site or omni-channel organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing 3PLs, including SLA ownership, contract management, and performance governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the end-to-end supply chain, from first mile through to final mile delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record as a change leader, owning and driving transformation across operational environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communicator and influencer with the ability to operate in regional, matrixed stakeholder environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;France-based operational experience is essential, with the ability to lead on-the-ground operations from a France base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and executing operational plans that deliver measurable improvements in speed, cost, and quality across multiple verticals and geographies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WORK LOCATION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hybrid: The primary place of performance of this role is the Company&#39;s office located in Paris, France, subject to the Company&#39;s current hybrid work policy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Fanatics, we operate with a BOLD mindset - We Build Championship Teams, we’re Obsessed with Fans, we embrace a Limitless Entrepreneurial Spirit, and we approach every challenge with a Determined and Relentless Mindset. If you’re ready to contribute to a dynamic, fast-paced environment that thrives on collaboration and growth, we want you to be part of our team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;ABOUT US&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics Commerce is a leading designer, manufacturer, and seller of licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods. It operates a vertically-integrated platform of digital and physical capabilities for leading sports leagues, teams, colleges, and associations globally – as well as its flagship site, &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanatics.com&quot;&gt;www.fanatics.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics Commerce has a broad range of online, sports venue, and vertical apparel partnerships worldwide, including comprehensive partnerships with leading leagues, teams, colleges, and sports organizations across the world—including the NFL, NBA, MLB, NHL, MLS, Formula 1, and Australian Football League (AFL); the Dallas Cowboys, Golden State Warriors, Paris Saint-Germain, Chelsea FC, and Tokyo Giants; the University of Notre Dame, University of Alabama, and University of Texas; the International Olympic Committee (IOC), England Rugby, and the Union of European Football Associations (UEFA).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Fanatics Commerce, we infuse our BOLD Leadership Principles in everything we do:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;· Build Championship Teams&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;· Obsessed with Fans&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;· Limitless Entrepreneurial Spirit&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;· Determined and Relentless Mindset&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a -----
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;blockquote&gt;Design, deliver and operate the AI platforms that power our customers&#39; most critical systems&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Schuberg Philis, we do more than deliver IT solutions. We design, build and operate business-critical systems that our customers rely on every day. From infrastructure to cloud-native platforms, every layer is engineered for maximum reliability and quality. Working closely with our customers, we ensure their most important processes continue to run smoothly, no matter how complex the environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced GenAI Python Engineer to join a small, close-knit and self-managing team. Our mission is to design and develop advanced AI platforms, AI-powered solutions and applications that transform the way our customers operate across a variety of industries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These platforms provide the foundation for innovation, reliability and scalability, supporting critical business processes in high-security environments. The solutions built on top of these platforms fundamentally change how our customers run their businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Ideal Colleague Has Experience With:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 6 years of proven commercial experience in a professional software engineering environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing, building and maintaining Generative AI applications, including deploying and operating them in production using Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with GenAI frameworks, libraries or platforms such as LangChain, TensorFlow, PyTorch or FastAPI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with Generative AI models in production environments, both open-source and proprietary, including models such as GPT, Llama and Claude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implementing and optimizing core GenAI components, including vector databases, embeddings, chunking strategies and evaluation frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving architectural decisions and contributing to the long-term technical vision of a platform or product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading technology adoption and change management initiatives to ensure cutting-edge solutions deliver measurable business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Verbind ambitie met waarde — word het gezicht van onze groei&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Wij geloven dat sales anders kan. En moet.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Bij Schuberg Philis werken we aan missiekritische IT-omgevingen die simpelweg&lt;em&gt; altijd moeten werken&lt;/em&gt;. Dat doen we al bijna 25 jaar voor organisaties die een groot stuk van Nederland draaiend houden: van banken en energiebedrijven tot publieke instellingen en transport &amp;amp; logistiek. Systemen die de ruggengraat vormen van Nederland. We leveren niet alleen technologie, maar vooral zekerheid en veranderkracht (weerbaar &amp;amp; wendbaar). En dat doen we op onze eigen manier.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Geen persoonlijke targets, geen bazen die bepalen wat je moet doen, geen cijfers om de cijfers. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Wel 100% eigenaarschap. 100% kwaliteit. En 100% klanttevredenheid.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;We staan aan de vooravond van een nieuwe groeifase. Uit recent strategisch onderzoek dat McKinsey voor ons heeft uitgevoerd, laat zien dat er enorme kansen liggen om onze naam met trots verder op de kaart te zetten. Daarom breiden we uit en willen we onze positie in Energie, Logistiek en Manufacturing industrie verder versterken. En zoeken we iemand die begrijpt dat groei niet begint bij pushen, maar bij luisteren.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;De uitdaging&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;We zijn lang het best bewaarde geheim van de Nederlandse IT-wereld geweest. Nu is het tijd dat iedereen ons leert kennen. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Weet jij hoe je deuren opent die normaal gesloten blijven? &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Kun jij complexe IT-uitdagingen vertalen naar strategische kansen? &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;En ben jij klaar om de verborgen parel van de Nederlands IT wereld zichtbaar te maken voor klanten die niets minder dan 100% betrouwbaarheid eisen? &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Dan is dit het moment om aan boord te stappen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Als&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Director Sales New Logo&lt;/strong&gt; krijg jij de vrijheid én verantwoordelijkheid om Schuberg Philis te positioneren bij nieuwe klanten binnen de Energie, Logistiek en Manufacturing industrie. Je brengt onze proposities, zoals Cloud, Data &amp;amp; AI, Software en Security, onder de aandacht. Niet door harder te roepen, maar door scherper en beter te luisteren.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Wat jij brengt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Je bent een bouwer met commercieel instinct en inhoudelijke scherpte.&lt;/strong&gt; Je weet hoe je een organisatie als Schuberg Philis positioneert: niet als leverancier, maar als partner die het verschil maakt wanneer het ertoe doet.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Je voelt je thuis op C-level.&lt;/strong&gt; Je stelt de vragen die anderen niet durven te stellen. Je schakelt moeiteloos tussen business-strategie en technologie n bouwt vertrouwen op door te luisteren, te duiden en samen te ontwerpen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Je denkt ondernemend en handelt resultaatgericht.&lt;/strong&gt; Je haalt energie uit groei, maar niet ten koste van kwaliteit. Je kijkt verder dan de deal van vandaag en bouwt relaties die jaren meegaan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Je gelooft in &lt;em&gt;diagnose before you prescribe.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Je weet dat klanttevredenheid begint met écht begrijpen wat er speelt. Je spreekt de taal van IT, Cloud, Data &amp;amp; AI, Software en Security en vertaalt die kennis naar waarde op directieniveau. Dat betekent dat je verkoopt wat ze echt nodig hebben, in plaats van dat je iedere euro die je tegenkomt probeert binnen te hengelen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Je bent een natuurlijke verbinder.&lt;/strong&gt; Je hebt een relevant netwerk in de Energie, Logistiek of Manufacturing industrie en weet precies hoe je daarbinnen relaties opbouwt die verder gaan dan de transactie.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Onze divisie realiseert digitale transformaties die er echt toe doen. Wij zijn verantwoordelijk voor digitalisering van de brouwerijen van Heineken, de software op de treinen van NS, maar ook de duurzame energie certificaten van de ACT Group en KLM.  Jij bouwt voort op dat fundament en brengt onze impact naar nieuwe klanten die even ambitieus zijn als wij. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Wat je meeneemt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Minimaal 10 jaar ervaring en een bewezen trackrecord in het ontwikkelen van new business binnen complexe IT- of technologieomgevingen,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Aantoonbaar vermogen om vraag te creëren die omzetgroei realiseert,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Ervaring met Value Selling, bij voorkeur via MEDDPICC of vergelijkbare methodieken,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Een actief netwerk in de Energie, Logistiek of Manufacturing,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Ervaring met compliance-gevoelige domeinen (NIS2, DORA) is een plus,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Uitstekende&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;communicatieve&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;vaardigheden&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt; in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;zowel&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Nederlands&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;als&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt; Engels.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Wat je krijgt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Een rol die groter is dan sales alleen. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Bij Schuberg Philis werk je niet in een commerciële silo, maar in een multidisciplinair team van engineers, architecten en strategen. Samen bouwen jullie aan verandering die ertoe doet voor klanten, voor Nederland, en voor de continuïteit van systemen die nooit stil mogen vallen. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Je krijgt ruimte om je eigen koers te varen, met de support van een sterk merk, bewezen proposities en cases die gewicht hebben. Je werkt autonoom, maar nooit alleen. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;En ja, de lat ligt hoog. Maar dat is precies waarom jij hier wilt zijn.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Klaar om het verschil te maken?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Catawiki, every day brings the extraordinary! Whether it’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Daniel Ricciardo’s Formula 1 Car&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/579-fossils&quot;&gt;Woolly Mammoth’s Skeleton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/l/10035805&quot;&gt;Lady Gaga&#39;s Jumpsuit&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Usain Bolt’s running shoe&lt;/a&gt;, we encounter exceptional objects every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a one-of-a-kind marketplace for buying and selling special objects. Each week, more than 100,000 unique items are auctioned, all carefully curated by our passionate in-house experts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having sold over 25 million unique objects, our mission is to become the world’s most popular destination for special objects. As a growing, diverse and sustainable scale-up, we proudly live by three core values. If these values resonate with you, we’d love to explore how you can join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership and driving impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being open to change and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being passionate about our mission and our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Your Mission&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;369&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Model Trains Expert&lt;/strong&gt;, your mission is to bring your specialist model trains expertise to the curation of high-quality, compelling auctions that attract engaged collectors and trusted sellers. Your knowledge of brands, rarity, condition, valuation, and collector expectations is central to ensuring each lot is relevant, accurately assessed, and commercially strong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;371&quot; data-end=&quot;580&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;By combining deep category expertise with sound commercial judgement, you play a key role in growing the Model Trains category, maintaining transparency, and strengthening trust within the collector community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;457&quot; data-end=&quot;471&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;475&quot; data-end=&quot;598&quot;&gt;Evaluate and arrange model train lots submitted by users, ensuring each auction features attractive and relevant listings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;601&quot; data-end=&quot;688&quot;&gt;Create compelling weekly lot selections using your expertise and professional network&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;691&quot; data-end=&quot;788&quot;&gt;Review titles, descriptions, and images to assess quality and provide accurate estimated values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;791&quot; data-end=&quot;873&quot;&gt;Safeguard transparent and fair transactions through consistent expert evaluation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;876&quot; data-end=&quot;975&quot;&gt;Communicate rejections professionally and diplomatically, maintaining strong seller relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;978&quot; data-end=&quot;1069&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Sales to attract new sellers and diversify the range and quality of lots&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1072&quot; data-end=&quot;1159&quot;&gt;Partner with Marketing to increase bidder engagement and visibility for your auctions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1182&quot; data-end=&quot;1216&quot;&gt;Expert knowledge in Model Trains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1219&quot; data-end=&quot;1282&quot;&gt;Strong commercial acumen and documented commercial experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1285&quot; data-end=&quot;1344&quot;&gt;An eye for trade and value within the collectibles market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1347&quot; data-end=&quot;1436&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to act diplomatically in user disputes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1439&quot; data-end=&quot;1501&quot;&gt;A network of potential sellers and experts within your field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1504&quot; data-end=&quot;1568&quot;&gt;Good computer skills and confidence working with digital tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1571&quot; data-end=&quot;1616&quot;&gt;Good command of English, written and spoken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Where You’ll Be&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1635&quot; data-end=&quot;1772&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;This is a 100% remote role that can be based in the Netherlands, Belgium, France, Germany, Italy, Portugal, Spain, or the United Kingdom.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text text-align-left &quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love Working with Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create a visible impact &lt;/strong&gt;by working at scale in a global organisation serving millions of customers across 80+ categories. In our flat structure, every role has a broad scope and directly impacts both our customers and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and grow&lt;/strong&gt; through our Learning &amp;amp; Development initiatives, including clear development plans and mentorship programmes to support your career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A culture of connection defines us&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re a passionate, diverse team of 800+ Catawikians representing 60+ nationalities. We foster an inclusive and queer-friendly environment where everyone is encouraged to bring their full self to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celebrate life’s moments with us. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll receive a €100 Catavoucher when you join, a €50 Catavoucher on your birthday, and an extra day off each year to “Pursue Your Passion&lt;strong&gt;”&lt;/strong&gt;. We also offer additional leave for key work anniversaries and important life events. Benefits may vary by location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offices and Way of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our vibrant offices in Amsterdam and Lisbon are designed to inspire collaboration. Most Catawikians operate in a hybrid setup, combining office-based and remote work, with a minimum of two days per week in the office, unless a role is explicitly stated as fully remote or fully office-based.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Apply with an English CV and Cover Letter. By applying, you agree to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/conditions/applicant-privacy-policy.pdf&quot;&gt;Catawiki’s Applicant Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Flexport:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Flexport, we believe global trade can move the human race forward. That’s why it’s our mission to make global commerce so easy there will be more of it. We’re shaping the future of a $10T industry with solutions powered by innovative technology and exceptional people. Today, companies of all sizes—from emerging brands to Fortune 500s—use Flexport technology to move more than $19B of merchandise across 112 countries a year.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The recent global supply chain crisis has put Flexport center stage as we continue to play a pivotal role in how goods move around the world. We are proud to have the support of the best investors in the game who believe in our mission, solutions and people. Ready to tackle global challenges that impact business, society, and the environment? Come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hundreds of engineers and thousands of freight operators around the world rely on Flexport&#39;s internal systems every single day to keep billions of dollars of freight moving. Keeping those systems — and the people who use them — secure is not a compliance checkbox. It&#39;s the core infrastructure for a company operating across 112 countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The PSI (Platform, Security &amp;amp; Infrastructure) team is looking for a Senior Security Engineer to own the security of Flexport&#39;s corporate environment: endpoints, identity systems, internal networks, and the SaaS estate. This is a security engineering role, not an IT support role, and not a role where you write policies and hope for the best. You&#39;ll build, automate, and be on the ground when things get real.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Endpoint &amp;amp; SaaS security&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own and mature our endpoint security stack (EDR) across macOS and Windows fleets&lt;/strong&gt;, writing device policy as code — configuration profiles, remediation scripts, and enforcement rules — with staged rollout and rollback built in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own security configuration and monitoring for Flexport&#39;s critical SaaS applications&lt;/strong&gt; (Google Workspace, Slack, and similar) through SSPM tooling, catching risky OAuth grants and configuration drift before they become incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Access management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Flexport&#39;s identity posture:&lt;/strong&gt; SSO coverage, phishing-resistant MFA and passkey rollout, SCIM lifecycle automation, and least-privilege access across the SaaS and cloud estate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Flexport&#39;s zero-trust journey&lt;/strong&gt; — making sure the right people have the right access, with the right controls, verified continuously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Detection &amp;amp; response&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and tune detection rules in our SIEM&lt;/strong&gt;, turning signal into actionable alerts, not noise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead incident response for security events:&lt;/strong&gt; triage, contain, remediate, and write the retrospective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vulnerability &amp;amp; risk management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run regular assessments of corporate endpoints&lt;/strong&gt; and prioritize findings by real business risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage vendor and third-party security reviews&lt;/strong&gt;, working with procurement and legal to evaluate risk before it lands in our environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Security enablement &amp;amp; leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with IT, Engineering, and People teams&lt;/strong&gt; to embed security into the way we work without creating friction that drives people to workarounds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop and maintain runbooks, playbooks, and internal documentation&lt;/strong&gt; that make the whole team more capable, and mentor engineers earlier in their career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring a point of view on how agentic AI tools and browser-based AI assistants change what corporate security needs to watch for&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You Should Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Typically &lt;strong&gt;5–8 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in enterprise security, corporate IT security, or information security engineering — we care more about what you&#39;ve built than the exact number. If you meet most of this, apply.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong working knowledge of endpoint security tooling:&lt;/strong&gt; DLP (Cyberhaven, Purview, Varonis, or similar) and EDR (CrowdStrike, SentinelOne, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practical SIEM experience&lt;/strong&gt;, writing detection logic, triaging alerts, and reducing false positive noise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience leading or playing a significant role in security incident response.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working knowledge of cloud environments&lt;/strong&gt; (AWS, GCP, or Azure).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with network security in a cloud-first environment (ZTNA, SASE, DNS filtering).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with infrastructure-as-code tools (Terraform) for security configuration management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SCIM, OIDC, and fine-grained authorization at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a high-growth, global technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scripting skills in Python, Bash, or similar, for automating detection, response, and operational tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to privacy regulations relevant to a European and global context (GDPR, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How We Work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We come to the office 3 times a week to hang out, whiteboard, and ship together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have the latest hardware and software, including frontier AI models on day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We&#39;re agile, but not dogmatic. Teams decide how they work best.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why This Role Is Special&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Broad ownership: you&#39;re not a cog in a large security org — you own the corporate security posture end to end, from endpoints to observability to incident response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real stakes: Flexport operates in 112 countries with a global workforce. Security here matters at a genuine scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, don&#39;t just operate: we want to automate and engineer our way to a stronger posture, not just run playbooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re part of PSI: the platform, security, and infrastructure teams work hand in hand at Flexport. We value engineering quality and treat security as infrastructure, not just policy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We sponsor visas for the right candidate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s in it for you&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An opportunity to contribute to one of the fastest-growing companies, where you&#39;ll have the chance to create a global impact while being part of a thriving multinational environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily catered lunches incl. vegetarian options, breakfast, snacks and soft drinks available in our office on a daily basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commute expenses: Flexport will cover home-office commuting costs for employees living outside of Amsterdam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 working days as vacation days based on full-time employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance: Flexport offers a collective health insurance plan including a basic package and any available additional packages. Your monthly premium is fully paid by Flexport.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A defined pension contribution scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity program: every team member becomes a shareholder, aligning our success with yours. As a private company in a multi-trillion dollar industry, you have a direct stake in our collective growth and success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program through Aetna Resources for Living: Flexport provides an employer-sponsored program at no cost to you and your household members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave benefit: Flexport is here to support you and your family during one of the most important times in life — the birth of a child. Our parental leave program allows both mothers and partners to take time off from work for pregnancy, childbirth, and to bond with your new child.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
