&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and test fast:&lt;/strong&gt; Create low and high fidelity prototypes to be evaluated with real customers on a weekly basis, staying in a continuous loop of hypothesis, test and learn.&lt;/li&gt;
